dsh-teaching-mode README · State：Default `$DSH_HOME/teaching-mode/state.json`, bucketed by session id (keys are `session-<uuid>`; the display id is the first 8 hex characters after the prefix):

```json
{
  "version": 1,
  "sessions": {
    "session-xxxx": {

Change the location with `statePath` or the environment variable `TEACHING_MODE_STATE`.

dsh-teaching-mode README · 状态存在哪：默认 `$DSH_HOME/teaching-mode/state.json`，按会话 id 分桶：

```json
{
  "version": 1,
  "sessions": {
    "session-xxxx": {

想换位置就配 `statePath`，或用环境变量 `TEACHING_MODE_STATE`。
